From f851f008706301b9c1f282a855b62f3b5d2b71a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mystic Builder Dev <dev@mysticbuilder.local>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:20:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Awakening loadout UI: full-screen game recreation with
 PAK-ripped assets

- New src/components/loadout/: pixel-faithful 1920x1080 Awakening loadout
  stage (transform-scaled), gear grid with lantern+omnicell split card,
  4 consumable slots (flask locked), center detail card, crest header with
  power/resist plaques, perk summary, item detail + cell slots, dye/transmog
  chrome (visual only), bottom bar (COPY/RANDOMIZE/RESET/IMPORT), and a
  full-screen game-style picker overlay with search/filters/keyboard nav
- Build id v9: consumable slots 2-4 appended, v8 links auto-upgrade
- New consumables dataset (tonics + pylons compiled from the wiki) with
  icons ripped from the official game PAKs via a headless CUE4Parse
  pipeline (tools/pak-extract)
- Cinzel + Source Sans 3 typography, Awakening design tokens
- item-select/build-editor retained for the database tab; builder tab is
  now the loadout stage
